abstract: >-
  Reproducible artifacts for three numerical contracts of the n=26
  variable-radius circle-packing problem, including an exact-rational
  finite-decimal certificate, independent verification, a historical
  public-corpus comparison snapshot, and contact-graph reconstruction.
